senses.gloss:
पशुः + -मारम् ind. according to the manner of slaughtering animals;
 निष्पिष्यैनं बलाद्भूमौ पशुमारममारयत् Mb. 1. 154. 30; Bhāg. 4. 13. 41;
 इष्टिपशुमारं मारितः Ś. 6.

पशव्य + .{@-व्यम्@}
—1 A herd of cattle.
—2 A stall for cattle.

पाशुपत + .{@-तः@}
—1 A follower and worshipper of Śiva.
—2 A follower of the doctrines of Paśupati.
